From: mscharged-port
Subject: Tweak: training without cheats
Upstream-base: 8b9d92dd88b4c727cc6359ee4cd5ba128cced7b8

Training's match (tweak patch 0038) is a friendly one, so it played with the
cheats of the save's Gameplay options (the launcher's match presets write
them there): custom power-ups, infinite ones, Butterfingers, Glass Jaw and
the rest. Every one of them is read through GameInfoManager::GetActiveRules,
which in the training match now answers the defaults, no cheat at all, and
leaves the save's own untouched. The port's own tweaks (Secure stadiums
among them) are the launcher's and stay as they are.

diff --git a/src/Game/GameInfo.cpp b/src/Game/GameInfo.cpp
index d07a995..e157115 100644
--- a/src/Game/GameInfo.cpp
+++ b/src/Game/GameInfo.cpp
@@ -324,6 +324,14 @@ const GameplaySettings* GameInfoManager::GetCurrentSettings() const
 
 const CheatSettings* GameInfoManager::GetActiveRules() const
 {
+#if defined(MSCHARGED_TWEAKS)
+    // Port tweak "Training": its match plays without the save's cheats.
+    if (g_bTrainingMatch) {
+        static CheatSettings sNoCheats;
+        sNoCheats.InitializeDefaults();
+        return &sNoCheats;
+    }
+#endif
     if (UseAltRules()) {
         return &mUnrankedCheatSettings;
     }
